   "title": "Note: what H3 gives you",
   "properties": {
    "cnr_id": null,
    "ver": "0.30.0",
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Frames are available\n\n`VAEDecode` emits the whole frame batch as IMAGE **before** anything muxes it\ninto a video. Save Shot writes them as a PNG sequence when `save_frames` is\non, and always writes H3's audio separately as `_h3.wav`.\n\n**There is no alpha channel.** H3 outputs opaque RGB with no matte, so\ncompositing here means grading, effects and titles - not lifting a character\noff a background.\n\nBudget ~16-50 GB of PNG per 12-minute episode at 1344x768. Leave\n`save_frames` off for shots that need no finishing work.\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Frames are available\n\n`VAEDecode` emits the whole frame batch as IMAGE **before** anything muxes it\ninto a video. Save Shot writes them as a PNG sequence when `save_frames` is\non, and always writes H3's audio separately as `_h3.wav`.\n\n**There is no alpha channel.** H3 outputs opaque RGB with no matte, so\ncompositing here means grading, effects and titles - not lifting a character\noff a background.\n\nBudget ~16-50 GB of PNG per 12-minute episode at 1344x768. Leave\n`save_frames` off for shots that need no finishing work.\n"
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
